About

    This folder contains the main repo files that now provide the DICE patch as part of the main code, rather than an actual patch, previously in patch/init/dice, now deprecated and deleted.

    I've kept the old patch here as 'dice-legacy', since it is the foundation of most of my Nexus framework. In time, I shall replace that by this new dice patch.

    The corresponding files have been copied from the main code here by visual inspection of the corresponding commit (00f593cd); see here:
    https://github.com/ramses-organisation/ramses/pull/280/files#diff-1fd97222012c2e0a2d401816dafc19c9171222d7e59166c87c49335a92185714

    They are listed in the file src_files.txt, for convenience.

    IMPORTANT:
    init_dice.f90 used to be init_flow_fine.f90. Now these have been split into two. init_dice.f90 appears to include a number of new routines (dice_mag_constant, dice_mag_compute, dice_mag_toroidal),
    plus routines previously spread across other patch's files:
        * rho_fine.f90:
            ngp_amr_gas(), multipole_from_current_level()
        * init_refine.f90:
            kill_gas_part()
        * init_flow_fine.f90, the following, renamed:
            reset_uold -> dice_reset_uold
            init_old -> dice_init_uold
            condinit_loc -> condinit_dice
            mag_constant -> dice_mag_constant
            mag_compute -> dice_mag_compute
            mag_toroidal -> dice_mag_toroidal
    dice_commons.f90 was previously declared inside read_params.f90

